OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman badly
OL,4,Ahurt in assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a woman
OL,7,Fwas seriously injured in Headingley.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FOakfield at about 00:27 BST where the
OL,11,F48-year-old was taken to hospital with
OL,12,Finjuries not thought to be
OL,13,Flife-threatening.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said a
OL,16,F47-year-old man had been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of grievous bodily harm and
OL,18,Fthat the assault was being treated as
OL,19,F"domestic-related".
